		"name": "02 The Trace",
		"description": "On the stage of space, the Trace records every deviation. When you pick up the point, it leaves a residue of motion that unsettles the grid’s desire for fixed identity. The Trace is the body’s movement rendered as a curve in VR space, yet up close the smooth line breaks into tiny segments—a jagged approximation that exposes the digital, discretized nature of motion. ",
